<title>USA: Tellabs acquires Trelcom Oy of Finland.</title>
<headline>Tellabs acquires Trelcom Oy of Finland.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said it has acquired Trelcom Oy of Espoo, Finland for about $3.04 million.</p>
<p>Tellabs said Trelcom specializes in digital subscriber line (DSL) technology.</p>
<p>DSL techology allows telephone operators to deliver high quality, high bandwidth services over existing copper lines that directly interface most subscribers.</p>
</text>
